    "view": {
      "value": "<p>Before you start using Connect (as PWA or Android App), you must setup the synchronization strategy first.   </p><h3 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-Steps\"><strong>Steps</strong></h3><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-SetLocationSyncstrategyinOpenmrsglobalproperty.\">Set LocationSync strategy in Openmrs global property. </h5><p>In Openmrs go to Advanced Settings and set sync strategy property</p><p><strong><strong>bahmniOfflineSync</strong>.<strong>strategy </strong></strong>with <strong>org.bahmni.module.bahmniOfflineSync.strategy.LocationBasedSyncStrategy</strong>.</p><p><br/></p><p>          <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.09.06%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512038373004&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=46\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.09.06%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512038373004&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"325943304\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-11-30 at 4.09.06 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"325713930\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"969c2da3-f161-4ee2-9ea0-2c2a8fa8173a\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.09.06%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512038373004&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1200&amp;height=92 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.09.06%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512038373004&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=600&amp;height=46 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-Setupaddresshierarchylevelsandaddresshierarchyentries.\">Set up address hierarchy levels and address hierarchy entries.</h5><ol><li>Refer this link <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/37945505/Configure+Address+Hierarchy\" data-linked-resource-id=\"37945505\" data-linked-resource-version=\"16\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Configure Address Hierarchy</a> to setup address hierarchy levels and adding address hierarchy entries using CSV upload.</li><li>Add user generated id for each address hierarchy entry in the database.</li></ol><p>              </p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3c0f5b75-c807-4c9d-a955-2e5cc8c8e2f6\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">update address_hierarchy_entry set user_generated_id=&lt;user_generated_id&gt; where address_hierarchy_entry_id=&lt;id&gt;; </pre>\n</div></div><p><br/></p><p>Sample user generated ids</p><p>              </p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"dbd59e16-8ff3-46fa-b11c-e6087e25231e\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: sql; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">select address_hierarchy_entry_id , name, level_id , parent_id , user_generated_id from address_hierarchy_entry;</pre>\n</div></div><p>              <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.25.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039360793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=110\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.25.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039360793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"325779479\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-11-30 at 4.25.47 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"325713930\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"56008e1b-d958-431d-b010-593e6b0442ed\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.25.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039360793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=220 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.25.47%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039360793&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=110 1x\"></span></p><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-Specifyaddressforloginlocation.\">Specify address for login location.</h5><p>In OpenMRS navigate to <em>Manage Locations</em> and add address to login location. Only the patients whose address matches with address of login location will sync to connect device.</p><p>           <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.26.59%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039531794&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=241\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.26.59%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039531794&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"325943318\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-11-30 at 4.26.59 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"325713930\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"7f7eef8b-3383-4d15-a3cd-89f6c6f180f1\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.26.59%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039531794&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=482 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.26.59%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039531794&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=241 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-AddPatientAttributecalledaddressCode.\">Add Patient Attribute called addressCode.</h5><p>In OpenMRS go to <em>Manage Person Attribute Types</em> and add new person attribute type called <strong>addressCode</strong>.</p><p>         <span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.30.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039700418&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=167\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.30.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039700418&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"325746716\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screen Shot 2017-11-30 at 4.30.34 PM.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"325713930\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"10\" data-media-id=\"d55e1887-49bf-4568-bb25-2e48da53f409\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.30.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039700418&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1000&amp;height=334 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/325713930/Screen%20Shot%202017-11-30%20at%204.30.34%20PM.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1512039700418&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=167 1x\"></span></p><p><br/></p><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-Configurevisitandencountertype.\">Configure visit and encounter type.</h5><p>In OpenMRS, &quot;Administration =&gt; Visits =&gt; Manage Visit Types&quot;, create a visit type with name &quot;FIELD&quot;.  </p><p>In OpenMRS, &quot;Administration =&gt; Encounters =&gt; Manage Encounter Types&quot; and create an encounter type with name &quot;Field&quot;.</p><p>  </p><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-Setupregistrationappconfig\">Setup registration app config</h5><p style=\"text-align: left;\" class=\"auto-cursor-target\"> Add the below config in registration.app.json file</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6c55a40a-a042-41d2-a97d-01bf9191d11c\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\"> &quot;addressHierarchy&quot;: {\n      &quot;showAddressFieldsTopDown&quot;: true\n },\n &quot;defaultVisitType&quot;: &quot;FIELD&quot;</pre>\n</div></div><p><br/></p><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-Generateconcatenatedconfigs\">Generate concatenated configs </h5><p><br/></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5dff0a80-e32e-4948-b968-7b5847bf4164\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">bahmni -i local concat-configs </pre>\n</div></div><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-\"><br/><br/></h5><h5 id=\"SetupBahmniConnectusingLocationbasedsyncstrategy-Createpatientzipfiles\">Create patient zip files</h5><p><br/></p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"3e0fb341-e7e7-4cc6-adef-152bd25d3847\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: bash; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">bahmni -i local create-connect-artifacts</pre>\n</div></div><p><br/></p>",
